<title>CANADA: Bre-X shares continue fall in heavy trade.</title>
<headline>Bre-X shares continue fall in heavy trade.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Canadian gold prospector Bre-X Minerals Ltd sank further on Wednesday as frenzied investors turned over more than 11 million shares of the volatile stock.</p>
<p>Bre-X was down 0.80 at 3.05 on massive late morning volume of 11.2 million shares on the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Bre-X was halted in Toronto for all but 22 minutes on Tuesday after technical difficulaties forced the TSE to shut down trading in the frenetically traded stock.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
